From 4b810b527efb7daf5c780aa2850d76df98d27f6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:10:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Payment page settles on load; dashboard fits a phone;
 declined orders owe nothing

- Public quote carries accepted_at / archived_at, and the payment page
  shows "already underway" / "paid in full" / "declined" on load instead
  of offering Pay deposit until the server refuses it.
- Admin dashboard at phone width laid out 530px wide (grid children could
  not shrink around the scrolling Open Orders table), so taps landed on
  the wrong element. min-w-0 on the grid and card.
- Declined order page header no longer shows a balance due.
- Browse seeds at most the first two words of a name-only line, so a
  pasted full product name no longer searches to zero results.
- Invoice filter chips wrap on phones instead of hiding Partial/Archived
  behind an unmarked scroll.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LYEMaMZPU19bz29YxAMBh6
